          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "descriptive note"
        }
      ],
      "content": "Tapestry: a figured textile used as a wall-hanging, carpet, bench-covering (banker) or bedspread (OED s.v. tapestry). Worked in wool, silk, caddis (crewel), hair, gold thread or verdure (foliage) designs; of fine or coarse quality; from France and Flanders."
    }
